WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
According to your testimony, this person came in and snatched the cash from the register.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.500
And you said you can identify this person?

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Absolutely.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Would you be surprised to learn that the person you just pointed to is not the defendant?

5
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.000
My client is at the back of the courtroom, Your Honor.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Objection!

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Oh, Mr. Goodman!

8
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.000
My brother is not a bad person.

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
I'm good at talking to people. Convincing people.

10
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
That's what I do all day, every day.

11
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.000
You're not the only one.

12
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.000
We've got a legal problem.

13
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
I'm the lawyer.

14
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
All I've done is try to make sure that you're not a real lawyer.

15
00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.000
What's that?

16
00:01:04.000 --> 00:02:10.000
[Music]
